{
    "title": "PW77 Simple Lady Watch Face",
    "description": "PWW77 - Simple Lady Watch Face is an elegant watch face for Wear OS that is designed with feminine colors and simple style in mind. This watch face brings a subtle and sophisticated look to your watch that perfectly suits your feminine taste.\r\n\r\nWith the PWW77 - Simple Lady Watch Face, you will not only get accurate time and date on your Wear OS device, but also provide you with simplicity and elegance. Its minimalist design with subtle shades of feminine colors creates a sense of lightness and sophistication on your wrist.\r\n\r\nThis watch face is designed to be easy to read and intuitive. The numbers are precisely balanced and clearly displayed on the dial, allowing you to read the time quickly and accurately. With no unnecessary elements, it focuses on the essential information to keep your gaze undistracted and calm.\r\n\r\nPWW77 - Simple Lady Watch Face is created for modern women who value simplicity and taste. It is designed to fit perfectly with every outfit and add a touch of elegance to every moment. Whether you're at work, at a social event or in your everyday life, this watch face will provide you with a stylish and sophisticated accessory.\r\n\r\nDownload PWW77 - Simple Lady Watch Face from Google Play and discover the beauty of simplicity in your watch. Let your wrist radiate with subtle and feminine colors that create an impression of elegance and charm. Show off your unique style with this perfect watch face that is designed for you - a modern woman with flair.\r\n\r\nContains information:\r\n- 12/24hr Digital Time based on phone settings\r\n- Date\r\n- Day\r\n- Battery %\r\n- Goal %\r\n- 3 App Shortcuts - You can set any application you want\r\n- Always ON Display\r\n- Steps\r\n- BPM Heart Rate\r\n\r\nHEARTRATE NOTES:\r\nThe watch face does not automatically measure and does not automatically display the HR result.\r\nTo view your current heart rate data you'll need to\r\ntake a manual measurement.\r\nTo do this, tap on the heart rate display area.\r\nWait a few seconds. The watch face will take a\r\nmeasurement and displaythe current result.\r\n\r\nCustomization:\r\nPossibility to change the color of the text and background\r\nPossibility to select any application you want 3x\r\n\r\nOpen Galaxy Wearable on your phone \u2192 watch faces \u2192 customize and set the watch face to your preference.\r\n\r\nor\r\n\r\n- 1. Touch and hold display\r\n- 2. Tap on customize option\r\n\r\nCHECK IMAGES IN THE PLAY STORE\r\n\r\nThis watch face supports all Wear OS devices with API Level 28+\r\n\r\n\u2709 If you have any questions, please contact us by e-mail papy.hodinky@gmail.com\r\nWe will be happy to assist you!\r\nhttps://sites.google.com/view/papywatchprivacypolicy\r\n\r\nExpression of the watch face:\r\nStylish, Cute, Fashionable, Elegant, Girly, Chic, Unique, Modern, Colorful, Simple, Minimalistic, Ladies, Women, Men, Female, Art, Nature, Pink, Purple, Gold, Black, Silver, Battery friendly",
